  "bodyHash": "UlHj92CcuLM=",
  "content": "<h2>功能特色</h2><h3>方塊/物品</h3><p>以下方塊/物品已統一整合，可在相關模組的所有製程與配方中運作。</p><p>模組優先級依下方配置區塊定義，優先級較低的模組物品會在 JEI/REI/EMI 中隱藏。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>煤焦炭粉</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>所有仿製方塊</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Copycats+</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Connected</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-dreams-and-desires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CD&amp;D</a></li>\n<li><strong>塑膠片</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>六向齒輪箱</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Connected</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Utilities</a></li>\n</ul><h3>流體</h3><p>以下流體已統一整合，可在相關模組的所有製程與配方中運作。</p><ul>\n<li><strong>原油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-love-war\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">C:L&amp;W</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Destroy</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>燃料</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC&amp;A</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSnR</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Destroy</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-garnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Garnished</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a><ul>\n<li>其他模組的燃料在 Ad Astra 火箭中的相容性，可透過啟用模組內含的資料包來關閉。</li>\n<li>目前僅有 TFMG 的燃料可在其發電機中運作，因為 TFMG 不支援自訂燃料類型。（<em>但可能有解決方案。</em>）</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>煤油、熔融/液態塑膠、潤滑油/潤滑油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n</ul><h2>安裝方式</h2><p>此模組目前僅支援 1.20.1 和 1.21.1 (neo)forge 版本。Fabric/Quilt 版本將於近期推出。</p><p>需同時安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost Unified</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 模組。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d757\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ddEBPlA.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting（官方合作夥伴）- 使用優惠碼 AMRONOS\">\n</a></p><p>Modrinth 連結：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddoncompatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/createaddoncompatibility</a></p><h2>相容性配置</h2><p>若要變更相容性中哪個模組具有優先權，請修改 <code>config/almostunified/unify.json</code> 中的 <code>modPriorities</code>。更多資訊請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/almostunified/wiki/Unification-Config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p>預設優先順序（由高至低）為：</p><pre><code>pneumaticcraft\ncopycats\ncreate_connected\ncreate_dd\ntfmg</code></pre><p><br></p><p>模組內含資料包，可讓您變更不同模組間相容性的某些設定。</p><p>可在建立世界時啟用，或使用 <code>/datapack enable</code> 指令啟用。</p><h2>建議 / 更多相容功能</h2><p>我已有計劃加入更多相容功能，但如果您有任何想法，歡迎在 GitHub 上發起 Issue，或在 Discord 伺服器中告訴我。</p><h2>致謝</h2><p>感謝：</p><ol>\n<li>本模組中已加入相容性的各個模組創作者。</li>\n<li>AlmostReliable 團隊製作了 Almost Unified，沒有這個模組，本模組的開發將會非常困難。</li>\n</ol>",
